  "note": "Triennial election of the Gilford Town Commissioners, January 1926. The Belfast News-Letter reports that the retiring members were re-elected without opposition. The paragraph names eight retiring members; no ninth name and no votes are printed. John Roberts is described as chairman. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026). Returned unopposed."
